# One lifetime for either a standalone topic or the continuous showcase.
Hide
Type "export ZE_CONFIG_DIR=/src/tmp/terminal-demos/state/showcase-lab/config ZE_SSH_PASSWORD=secret123 SSHPASS=secret123"
Enter
Type "ze-demo run showcase-lab prepare"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Showcase lab prepared/
Type "ze-demo run showcase-lab start"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Showcase lab ready/
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
